WEBVTT

01:14.491 --> 01:16.701
Pi.

01:18.661 --> 01:19.496
Let's go.

01:20.538 --> 01:22.082
To Papa's place!

01:26.294 --> 01:27.628
TSUGARU KAIKYO FERRY

01:27.629 --> 01:28.546
HAKODATE

01:47.357 --> 01:48.233
TOP SECRET: SUMMER BREAK PLANNER
CLASS 4-1, NAOKI AZUMA

02:00.286 --> 02:03.414
GRILLED SNACK

02:21.474 --> 02:25.019
Is this "Papa's place," pi?

02:26.813 --> 02:27.814
I'm going to see him.

02:29.149 --> 02:31.650
<i>I'm going to see him...</i>

02:31.651 --> 02:33.277
<i>I'm going to see him.</i>

02:33.278 --> 02:35.446
<i>I'm going to see Chappy soon!</i>

02:38.825 --> 02:40.243
<i>And Dad too.</i>

02:41.244 --> 02:42.453
<i>Coming.</i>

02:44.998 --> 02:46.416
Dad!

02:50.336 --> 02:51.921
Shizuka?

02:52.797 --> 02:54.131
Why are you here all of a sudden?

02:54.132 --> 02:55.132
Dad...

02:55.133 --> 02:56.676
Daddy!

02:57.177 --> 02:58.219
What's wrong, Satsuki?

02:58.887 --> 03:00.095
- It's dangerous.
- Come here.

03:00.096 --> 03:01.471
- Eri is sleeping.
- Come here.

03:01.472 --> 03:04.391
- Dad...
- Come on, play with me!

03:04.392 --> 03:06.518
I told you it's dangerous.

03:06.519 --> 03:09.063
- No. Hug me!
- Dad...

03:10.648 --> 03:14.444
Dad, I'm here to see Chappy.

03:15.612 --> 03:16.821
Chappy?

03:17.488 --> 03:19.782
Look, that's Chappy's barking!

03:23.453 --> 03:24.870
It's not Chappy.

03:24.871 --> 03:28.166
Daddy, who is she?

03:29.834 --> 03:32.920
Why is she calling you "Dad"?

03:32.921 --> 03:35.924
Well...

03:43.097 --> 03:45.516
I'm not very sure.

03:57.403 --> 04:00.782
Maybe those two kids ate Chappy.

04:01.574 --> 04:04.493
Just like how Takopi also
eats fallen cicadas, right?

04:04.494 --> 04:06.246
Maybe it's like that.

04:06.913 --> 04:08.039
Shizuka...

04:08.623 --> 04:12.501
- Then we have to get Chappy back.
- Shizuka...

04:12.502 --> 04:14.837
Maybe we can find out
by checking their stomach.

04:15.922 --> 04:17.131
Shizuka...

04:25.807 --> 04:27.308
Takopi.

04:28.059 --> 04:31.980
Give me a gadget that can catch humans
and check inside their stomach.

04:32.772 --> 04:35.357
I don't know-pi.

04:35.358 --> 04:37.818
There's no such gadget-pi.

04:37.819 --> 04:39.736
You're lying.

04:39.737 --> 04:41.488
- Shizuka...
- Forget it, then.

04:41.489 --> 04:43.741
- I'll figure it out myself.
- Ouch!

04:44.492 --> 04:46.618
Shizuka, don't do this-pi.

04:46.619 --> 04:49.079
If I use this, I can sneak in
at night without being noticed.

04:49.080 --> 04:51.457
Shizuka, listen to me.

04:54.085 --> 04:55.211
Shizuka.

04:57.213 --> 04:59.048
Let's go home.

05:01.301 --> 05:02.635
I'm sorry.

05:05.221 --> 05:09.141
I'm so stupid and useless-pi.

05:09.142 --> 05:13.520
That's why you ended up pushing yourself
until you were battered and broken.

05:13.521 --> 05:18.025
I'm sorry, so let's go home-pi.

05:18.026 --> 05:20.569
Besides,
if it's a fun gadget to play with,

05:20.570 --> 05:21.486
I have it-pi.

05:21.487 --> 05:25.157
With Flappy Flappy Wings,
we can slightly float in the air,

05:25.158 --> 05:28.243
or with Transformation Palette,
we can transform into caterpillars.

05:28.244 --> 05:30.705
It will definitely be fun-pi.

05:31.456 --> 05:34.625
I hope you can be
your old self again, Shizuka.

05:35.376 --> 05:38.129
I just want you to smile...

05:39.797 --> 05:43.509
Takopi, you're also not going
to help me anymore?

05:44.135 --> 05:45.469
Forget it then.

05:45.470 --> 05:48.514
<i>Huh? I think I've seen...</i>

05:50.808 --> 05:52.602
<i>that look somewhere before.</i>

05:54.520 --> 05:55.896
<i>- Do you want some?
- I've always been lonely.</i>

05:55.897 --> 05:56.855
<i>I told you it's gross.</i>

05:56.856 --> 05:58.940
<i>You broke the most important rule</i>

05:58.941 --> 06:00.150
<i>- of Happians.
- I'm sorry...</i>

06:00.151 --> 06:01.234
<i>I got it-pi--</i>

06:01.235 --> 06:03.111
<i>- I hate being alone.
- Ever since then, I've been...</i>

06:03.112 --> 06:04.863
<i>This is your...</i>

06:04.864 --> 06:06.199
<i>sin.</i>

06:10.703 --> 06:12.038
<i>That's right.</i>

06:18.378 --> 06:20.713
<i>How could I forget that?</i>

06:24.425 --> 06:25.926
<i>That's strange.</i>

06:25.927 --> 06:28.888
Hello? Is anyone in there?

06:29.555 --> 06:30.389
2022, 26TH HOUSE OF COUNCILLORS ELECTION

06:30.390 --> 06:31.432
What?

06:32.016 --> 06:33.309
Pi.

06:35.353 --> 06:37.145
I am a Happian.

06:37.146 --> 06:39.231
I'm here to make everyone happy-pi.

06:39.232 --> 06:42.025
Please tell me first-pi.

06:42.026 --> 06:43.444
Um...

06:45.113 --> 06:46.823
What's your name?

06:50.701 --> 06:51.702
Marina.

06:53.538 --> 06:55.206
<i>Marina Kirarazaka.</i>

06:59.585 --> 07:01.212
I'm a Happian.

07:01.796 --> 07:03.213
If you don't mind,

07:03.214 --> 07:06.050
I'd like you to give me a happy name
in Earth language-pi.

07:08.010 --> 07:09.887
Then let's call you useless trash.

07:12.306 --> 07:13.849
Guys, look at that girl.

07:13.850 --> 07:16.143
Look at the scar on her face.

07:16.144 --> 07:17.853
She looks like a gangster.

07:17.854 --> 07:18.895
So scary.

07:18.896 --> 07:21.148
I heard she hits people all the time.

07:21.149 --> 07:22.399
Why's there a chameleon plant in her hair?

07:22.400 --> 07:25.318
But she looks kind of cool.

07:25.319 --> 07:26.404
Marina.

07:27.196 --> 07:29.531
I want to thank you for the meal-pi.

07:29.532 --> 07:30.907
This is my Happy Gadget.

07:30.908 --> 07:32.410
- Shut up!
- Pi.

07:33.369 --> 07:34.411
Flower Pin.

07:34.412 --> 07:35.871
Let's pretend to be a flower with this.

07:35.872 --> 07:37.623
- Who would do that?
- Pi.

07:38.458 --> 07:39.332
Marina.

07:39.333 --> 07:42.837
It's a ballpoint pen that can make
the sound of a Saturn rabbit.

07:43.796 --> 07:47.925
Hey, you. Behave yourself at home.

07:50.636 --> 07:55.390
<i>The tenth round of COVID-19 vaccinations,
which began a few days ago,</i>

07:55.391 --> 07:59.394
<i>has raised concerns
over repeated booster doses.</i>

07:59.395 --> 08:00.520
IS IT REALLY EFFECTIVE?

08:00.521 --> 08:04.107
- <i>Additional shots can significantly reduce</i>
- Welcome home, Mari.

08:04.108 --> 08:06.776
- <i>severe illness and hospitalization risks,</i>
- Mama.

08:06.777 --> 08:08.320
- <i>but some experts</i>
- Mari.

08:08.321 --> 08:10.614
- <i>have warned about possible side effects.</i>
- You're up.

08:10.615 --> 08:12.157
- I thought you were sleeping.
- Pi.

08:12.158 --> 08:14.702
- I'll prepare dinner now.
- Hey, Mari.

08:15.578 --> 08:17.871
- Give me kombucha.
- Sorry for coming home so late.

08:17.872 --> 08:20.123
Something came up today.

08:20.124 --> 08:21.500
Oh, kombucha?

08:21.501 --> 08:23.002
Okay, I'll get you some right away.

08:26.214 --> 08:27.923
Mari.

08:27.924 --> 08:30.175
Have you taken your medicine?

08:30.176 --> 08:32.761
I heard the side effects are nightmares.

08:32.762 --> 08:34.180
- Mari.
- Let me see.

08:34.931 --> 08:37.182
Kombucha...

08:37.183 --> 08:38.684
KOMBUCHA

08:39.894 --> 08:41.771
- Sorry, there's no more...
- I already told you.

08:44.941 --> 08:51.822
Why didn't you just order
a whole box online before it ran out?

08:54.116 --> 08:57.118
Do you think Mama
only deserves this cheap liquor?

08:57.119 --> 08:58.036
Mama...

08:58.037 --> 09:03.333
What Mama needs is pure alcohol
fermented from kombucha.

09:03.334 --> 09:06.545
- Don't you think so too?
- Mama, no...

09:06.546 --> 09:09.631
You can't even do housework properly.

09:09.632 --> 09:13.052
- That's why no man will talk to you!
- I'm sorry, Mama.

09:14.178 --> 09:17.056
Hey, are you saying it's my fault?

09:18.099 --> 09:19.641
Do you also think

09:19.642 --> 09:22.686
I'm this useless
because I didn't have enough breast milk?!

09:22.687 --> 09:25.146
- <i>It's so lively.</i>
- Because I didn't raise my child well?!

09:25.147 --> 09:30.444
Glass... Glass is scary.

09:31.112 --> 09:34.824
I made Mama angry when I was a kid.

09:35.324 --> 09:37.034
G-Glass.

09:37.660 --> 09:41.789
I got this scar from a glass cup.

09:42.540 --> 09:44.916
G-Glass...

09:44.917 --> 09:46.293
- Pi...
- Glass...

09:46.294 --> 09:49.922
I want to be a happy mother,

09:50.965 --> 09:53.174
to have happy children,

09:53.175 --> 09:54.676
and raise them happily.

09:54.677 --> 09:55.636
Pi.

09:56.512 --> 09:58.471
- If I do that, Mama will...
- Today's snack is delicious.

09:58.472 --> 10:00.390
- Pi. What?
- I'm glad to hear that.

10:00.391 --> 10:02.934
So you're imitating-pi.

10:02.935 --> 10:04.394
Imitating what?

10:04.395 --> 10:08.231
I mean, you always touch me so hard.

10:08.232 --> 10:10.901
You're imitating Mama, right-pi?

10:11.902 --> 10:15.781
That's how humans practice parenting-pi.

10:16.907 --> 10:20.493
Marina, I'm sure
you'll be a good mother-pi.

10:20.494 --> 10:21.411
That was close.

10:21.412 --> 10:24.749
- Be careful.
- Then I'll help you become a mama-pi.

10:26.292 --> 10:29.085
First, we need to pick a papa-pi.

10:29.086 --> 10:32.255
Let's go find a papa together now-pi.

10:32.256 --> 10:34.674
Hey, it's none of your business.

10:34.675 --> 10:36.510
Kirarazaka?

10:44.185 --> 10:45.769
<i>And then,</i>

10:45.770 --> 10:49.523
we met again by chance in the summer
after elementary school.

10:50.691 --> 10:53.193
We started dating after that.

10:53.194 --> 10:54.152
Wow.

10:54.153 --> 10:56.613
So that's what happened, Mari.

10:56.614 --> 10:59.784
What? You should've told me sooner.

11:00.451 --> 11:02.285
So I want to introduce you
to him next time.

11:02.286 --> 11:04.163
That sounds good.
Mama's looking forward to it.

11:04.872 --> 11:07.791
Papa's work is pretty rough too
because of COVID-19.

11:07.792 --> 11:10.126
I think he'll be home soon.

11:10.127 --> 11:12.838
Let's all have dinner together then.

11:14.799 --> 11:15.632
IT'S ABOUT TIME SHE ACCEPTED MEDIATION.
MARINA, HELP PAPA TALK TO HER.

11:15.633 --> 11:16.591
I'VE REACHED MY LIMIT ALREADY.
I JUST WANT TO START A NEW LIFE.

11:16.592 --> 11:19.260
He's the son of that clinic, right?

11:19.261 --> 11:21.722
I'm looking forward to his future.

11:22.848 --> 11:24.224
About that...

11:24.225 --> 11:26.143
My big brother's the one inheriting it.

11:28.896 --> 11:30.940
I'd better not ask.

11:33.234 --> 11:36.528
But it's been a while
since I talked to Mama like this.

11:36.529 --> 11:37.780
Is that so-pi?

11:38.322 --> 11:40.574
I wonder if Nao secretly
has a sweet tooth.

11:41.117 --> 11:43.368
He seems to like pancakes.

11:43.369 --> 11:45.204
I'll make some for him next time.

11:45.788 --> 11:46.706
Besides...

11:48.207 --> 11:50.917
he doesn't care about my scar.

11:50.918 --> 11:52.168
Is she talking to herself?

11:52.169 --> 11:53.254
Crazy.

11:54.755 --> 11:55.840
When...

11:56.340 --> 11:58.633
I was a kid, a lot of things happened.

11:58.634 --> 12:00.176
Papa left home.

12:00.177 --> 12:02.096
Mama became a different person.

12:02.722 --> 12:04.973
I didn't have any close classmates.

12:04.974 --> 12:06.350
I've always been lonely.

12:07.977 --> 12:09.018
But lately...

12:09.019 --> 12:11.522
Are you happy?

12:14.066 --> 12:16.277
<i>Pi...</i>

12:17.403 --> 12:18.278
But...

12:18.279 --> 12:19.195
FEEL THE SEA OF HOKKAIDO
YOUR SERENE GETAWAY AWAITS

12:19.196 --> 12:22.199
if it weren't for you,
I probably wouldn't have taken that path.

12:23.200 --> 12:26.036
And if I hadn't, I wouldn't have met Nao.

12:27.955 --> 12:28.873
So...

12:29.498 --> 12:31.041
How should I put it?

12:33.127 --> 12:35.296
I've been doing pretty well lately.

12:38.257 --> 12:39.341
<i>Thank you.</i>

12:46.849 --> 12:48.642
Did you hear about the transfer student?

12:49.935 --> 12:52.187
I heard she's really pretty.

12:52.188 --> 12:53.772
She's from around here, right?

12:53.773 --> 12:56.566
But it seems like something
happened in the past.

12:56.567 --> 12:57.901
Do you still remember?

12:57.902 --> 12:59.402
That incident from a few years ago.

12:59.403 --> 13:00.529
The one where...

13:01.113 --> 13:03.240
she tried to commit suicide.

13:09.455 --> 13:11.456
Seriously?

13:11.457 --> 13:13.416
I heard the rope broke halfway.

13:13.417 --> 13:16.086
Sorry, Nao. You didn't like it?

13:16.796 --> 13:18.547
I accidentally touched your hand.

13:20.508 --> 13:21.801
What's wrong?

13:29.892 --> 13:32.394
I'm all Kuze has.

13:33.062 --> 13:36.981
She came back to her hometown
all by herself, with no one to rely on.

13:36.982 --> 13:38.900
I think it's a miracle
that I get to meet her again.

13:38.901 --> 13:40.443
Mom, hurry up!

13:40.444 --> 13:42.655
I've been attracted to her
since elementary school.

13:43.405 --> 13:44.865
I'm the only one she can rely on now.

13:45.699 --> 13:48.409
I also know she's the only one for me.

13:48.410 --> 13:49.495
That's why...

13:50.329 --> 13:51.497
<i>Mari.</i>

13:52.122 --> 13:54.207
Why isn't Azuma here yet?

13:54.208 --> 13:56.502
It's been a long time
since Mama cooked up a feast.

13:57.378 --> 14:00.005
I even made your favorite Bavarian cream.

14:00.589 --> 14:04.343
I'm so excited.
I wonder if he'll be happy.

14:04.969 --> 14:08.263
Look, I even did my hair.

14:08.264 --> 14:11.308
Pi! I'll go get Azuma then-pi.

14:12.142 --> 14:13.602
Wait for me-pi.

14:17.231 --> 14:19.233
I'm sorry for calling you out so suddenly.

14:23.571 --> 14:25.613
Don't you have any plans?

14:25.614 --> 14:29.076
You're the only one I know, Azuma.

14:29.827 --> 14:32.454
And no one's willing to talk to me.

14:33.414 --> 14:35.666
That's not true. I think you're...

14:39.295 --> 14:42.089
You're very attractive.

14:44.925 --> 14:47.010
What about you? Are you okay?

14:47.011 --> 14:49.555
Unlike me, you must be busy.

14:50.180 --> 14:51.599
Not at all.

14:53.350 --> 14:54.310
<i>Well,</i>

14:54.894 --> 14:58.355
Nao said he can't come today.

14:59.356 --> 15:01.400
That's so sudden.

15:01.901 --> 15:03.819
It can't be helped.

15:04.528 --> 15:06.155
What about next time?
When's the next time?

15:06.739 --> 15:08.616
When can he come next?

15:13.621 --> 15:14.538
Mari?

15:15.164 --> 15:17.458
Um... listen.

15:19.168 --> 15:20.294
I...

15:27.968 --> 15:29.386
I'm sorry.

15:31.972 --> 15:33.432
It's all my fault.

15:34.516 --> 15:37.186
Kirarazaka must be really hurt.

15:38.228 --> 15:39.563
I always give up halfway.

15:40.898 --> 15:43.651
I can't be as good as Junya.

15:46.362 --> 15:48.656
What did you do?

15:50.532 --> 15:53.077
If you don't say anything, I won't know!

15:56.622 --> 15:58.582
Is it because of that scar again?

15:59.208 --> 16:01.626
I'm a terrible mother.

16:01.627 --> 16:04.295
It's my fault
that you've become defective.

16:04.296 --> 16:07.507
- That's not true!
- But because of that,

16:07.508 --> 16:10.344
didn't I do well today?

16:11.845 --> 16:14.098
I even made so much food.

16:16.809 --> 16:19.770
Nao is in love with someone else.

16:27.027 --> 16:28.237
It's okay.

16:29.989 --> 16:31.365
It's okay.

16:32.241 --> 16:34.493
You don't have
to compare yourself to others.

16:35.285 --> 16:38.789
I'll be watching you.

16:40.624 --> 16:43.167
- You're always like this.
- I'm sorry...

16:43.168 --> 16:45.295
- You look down on Mama, don't you?
- I'm sorry...

16:46.380 --> 16:48.673
<i>Even you're not on my side anymore?</i>

16:48.674 --> 16:51.635
I've done so much for you!

16:52.302 --> 16:54.513
<i>Why are you like this too?</i>

16:59.184 --> 17:00.436
What is this?

17:02.604 --> 17:04.732
zIs it my fault?

17:06.316 --> 17:10.571
All of it... dAll of it...

17:11.530 --> 17:13.574
is my fault!

17:30.799 --> 17:34.261
In the end, I couldn't talk to him-pi.

17:40.726 --> 17:42.394
Marina!

17:45.147 --> 17:47.316
Marina, I'm home-pi.

17:48.108 --> 17:52.278
I'm sorry-pi. I couldn't bring Azuma back.

17:52.279 --> 17:54.072
The person who was with him

17:54.073 --> 17:55.907
- had a scary look in her eyes.
- I'm sorry...

17:55.908 --> 17:57.575
- She's scary-pi.
- I'm sorry...

17:57.576 --> 17:59.952
- What are you doing-pi?
- I'm sorry...

17:59.953 --> 18:01.330
I'm sorry...

18:02.289 --> 18:03.582
I'm sorry...

18:04.625 --> 18:08.212
I should have just killed her
when we were in fourth grade.

18:09.254 --> 18:10.464
I should've killed Shizuka Kuze.

18:11.173 --> 18:12.674
If I had, then Papa

18:13.300 --> 18:15.427
and Nao would have stayed with me.

18:17.554 --> 18:18.430
Hey.

18:18.931 --> 18:22.600
Mama, don't leave me alone.

18:22.601 --> 18:23.727
Marina.

18:29.691 --> 18:33.529
What the hell? You're still here?

18:34.029 --> 18:35.197
Marina.

18:35.823 --> 18:37.198
What's this?

18:37.199 --> 18:38.659
Why did this happen?

18:40.536 --> 18:43.997
If I had known,
I would have given you a name.

18:44.957 --> 18:46.917
- Hey.
- I got it-pi!

18:52.756 --> 18:54.550
I just have to kill her-pi.

18:55.134 --> 18:58.636
I just have to go back
to "when you were in fourth grade"

18:58.637 --> 19:00.555
and kill "Shizuka Kuze"?

19:00.556 --> 19:02.307
That'll make you happy-pi.

19:03.016 --> 19:05.769
I can easily do it
with the Happy Big Clock-pi.

19:06.562 --> 19:09.523
I've got this. Wait for me-pi.

19:11.817 --> 19:13.235
Bye-bye.

19:26.915 --> 19:30.252
I really should have given him a name.

19:32.796 --> 19:35.465
Something like... Takopi.

19:43.140 --> 19:45.474
Pick Happy Fruits for me-pi.

19:45.475 --> 19:46.434
Okay-pi.

19:46.435 --> 19:48.437
Thank you-pi.

19:52.232 --> 19:53.066
That's why, Mama,

19:53.692 --> 19:55.401
I'm going to use this Happy Big Clock

19:55.402 --> 19:59.364
to go back to when they were
in fourth grade and kill Shizuka Kuze-pi.

20:05.871 --> 20:07.039
I understand.

20:07.956 --> 20:08.790
Pi!

20:09.791 --> 20:12.335
If that's your answer...

20:12.336 --> 20:13.837
Pi...

20:14.922 --> 20:17.632
I'll erase all your memories

20:17.633 --> 20:20.761
and return you to the Happy State
when you were born.

20:22.429 --> 20:24.806
You came here alone

20:25.724 --> 20:29.353
and broke the most important rule
of Happians.

20:29.937 --> 20:33.482
You can no longer come back
to this planet.

20:34.483 --> 20:37.945
Therefore, you must be reborn.

20:39.947 --> 20:42.074
Forget everything.

20:43.617 --> 20:44.784
<i>That means...</i>

20:44.785 --> 20:46.078
<i>This is...</i>

20:47.454 --> 20:49.080
This is wrong-pi!

20:49.081 --> 20:49.997
Ouch!

20:49.998 --> 20:51.458
- What-pi?
- I'm scared-pi.

20:52.542 --> 20:53.960
What are you doing?

20:53.961 --> 20:56.004
Mama is so unreasonable-pi!

20:57.714 --> 20:58.632
I am...

21:00.926 --> 21:02.385
going back-pi!

21:02.386 --> 21:04.888
But your memories are already...

21:05.639 --> 21:08.976
Pi!

21:14.940 --> 21:17.234
Nnu-Anu-Kf...

21:21.113 --> 21:22.864
What does "kill" mean?

21:24.199 --> 21:26.952
Why did you have to touch me so hard?

21:27.953 --> 21:30.956
Talk to me properly and tell me-pi.

21:35.585 --> 21:37.586
<i>Don't worry-pi, Mari--</i>

21:37.587 --> 21:40.882
<i>I'll definitely make you happy.</i>

21:41.883 --> 21:44.219
<i>Even if I lose my memories, I'll do it.</i>

21:47.723 --> 21:50.183
<i>Na...</i>

21:51.768 --> 21:52.769
<i>Weird...</i>

21:53.437 --> 21:58.400
<i>Who was it that I wanted to make smile?</i>

22:05.949 --> 22:08.201
<i>How could I have forgotten?</i>

22:10.454 --> 22:11.621
<i>I have to kill...</i>

22:14.458 --> 22:16.793
<i>I have to kill Shizuka Kuze.</i>

22:18.420 --> 22:20.713
<i>I have to kill Shizuka Kuze.</i>

22:20.714 --> 22:23.841
<i>I have to completely destroy her life.</i>

22:23.842 --> 22:25.761
<i>I remember everything now.</i>

22:26.386 --> 22:28.179
<i>It's all Shizuka Kuze's fault</i>

22:28.180 --> 22:31.308
<i>that Marina lost her papa, Azuma,</i>

22:32.142 --> 22:34.102
<i>and her most precious mama.</i>

22:34.853 --> 22:36.854
<i>I have to kill her...</i>

22:36.855 --> 22:38.481
<i>Shizuka Kuze is a bad person.</i>

22:38.482 --> 22:39.398
<i>I have to kill her.</i>

22:39.399 --> 22:40.609
<i>Huh? But...</i>

22:41.735 --> 22:44.321
<i>At that time,
Marina did something terrible.</i>

22:44.905 --> 22:46.782
<i>Isn't she bad too?</i>

22:47.491 --> 22:48.408
<i>And what about me?</i>

22:49.618 --> 22:52.286
<i>I killed Marina.</i>

22:52.287 --> 22:53.579
<i>Hey.</i>

22:53.580 --> 22:55.665
Are you hungry?

22:59.461 --> 23:01.338
Do you want the bread from school lunch?

23:01.922 --> 23:03.715
I can't finish it anyway.

23:05.550 --> 23:06.802
<i>At that time,</i>

23:08.053 --> 23:10.931
<i>Shizuka gave me bread.</i>

23:13.392 --> 23:14.351
Hey.

23:17.646 --> 23:21.108
What are you doing here, you octopus?

23:24.528 --> 23:25.862
<i>Azuma...</i>
